          "value": "<section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-bpS9qNbP9Cedo6Io\"><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +4 to hit, reach 5 ft., one creature. <em>Hit:</em> 4 (1d4 + 2) piercing damage plus 2 (1d4) acid damage. At the end of each of its turns, the target must make a DC 10 Constitution saving throw, taking 2 (1d4) acid damage on a failure or ending the recurring acid damage on a success. A @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.F0GsG0SJzsIOacwV]{lesser restoration} spell cast on the target also ends the recurring acid damage.</p><p><strong>Foundry Tip:</strong> The recurring acid damage is implemented in the \"Other\" formula.</p></section><p>The flumph attacks with its tendrils.</p>",
